  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added experimental image support through base64-encoded request assets, with automatic TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images opt-in. AssetState and its asynchronous AddImageAsset helper load images through TruePath with optional injectable file access. ImageAsset.FromByteArray(name, format, bytes) creates an asset using standard padded base64 without line breaks or a data URI prefix; callers supply the matching format. BoxQuestionBuilder and BoxAnswer support normalized bounding boxes with confidence. The bundled source generator recognizes IBoxQuestionDefinition and GenericBoxQuestionDefinition, generating requests, typed answer methods, and response wrapper properties. Requests without an explicit model now re-evaluate model selection before execution, selecting JevModel.Preview for Box questions added after construction and JevModel.Latest otherwise; explicit model choices are preserved. Added AnswerExtensions helpers OnlyNoul(), OnlyChoice(), OnlyScoreAnswer(), and OnlyBoxAnswer() for typed answer filtering. API error translation preserves JSON or raw response content and retains the HTTP failure description in exception messages. Added known-error handling for HTTP 400, 413, 415, and 529 while retaining 509 support. Duplicate asset fields no longer replace registered assets before throwing. Updated documentation and regression coverage for image requests, generated Box queries, and API errors.",
